#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"B<int fstatat(int >I<dirfd>B<, const char *restrict >I<pathname>B<,>\n"
"B<         struct stat *restrict >I<statbuf>B<, int >I<flags>B<);>\n"
msgstr ""
"B<int fstatat(int >I<dirfd>B<, const char *restrict >I<padnaam>B<,>\n"
"B<         struct stat *beperk >I<statbuf>B<, int >I<vlaggen>B<);>\n"

